      <incoming>Id_b228c36c-ab69-4a23-a614-aa186c95a001</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_5bcab7dd-fd05-470a-90a7-4616358e9a6c</outgoing>
      <resourceRole id="Id_bf8d3094-e1bc-4e4b-acc3-b1dce5b420f5">
        <q5:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q5="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Municipios</q5:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <callActivity id="Id_7ca47d81-b816-4403-80ae-90d69c604af3" name="SP4. Elaborar a Análise de Risco" calledElement="Id_a3683afd-df40-4274-837e-b8007724d6e3">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Art. 6&amp;ordm; Para os fins desta Lei, consideram-se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XXVII - matriz de riscos: cl&amp;aacute;usula contratual definidora de riscos e de responsabilidades entre as partes ecaracterizadora do equil&amp;iacute;brio econ&amp;ocirc;mico-financeiro inicial do contrato, em termos de &amp;ocirc;nus financeiro decorrente deeventos supervenientes &amp;agrave; contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, contendo, no m&amp;iacute;nimo, as seguintes informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) listagem de poss&amp;iacute;veis eventos supervenientes &amp;agrave; assinatura do contrato que possam causar impacto em seuequil&amp;iacute;brio econ&amp;ocirc;mico-financeiro e previs&amp;atilde;o de eventual necessidade de prola&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de termo aditivo por ocasi&amp;atilde;o de suaocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) no caso de obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de resultado, estabelecimento das fra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do objeto com rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;agrave;s quais haver&amp;aacute;liberdade para os contratados inovarem em solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es metodol&amp;oacute;gicas ou tecnol&amp;oacute;gicas, em termos de modifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dassolu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es previamente delineadas no anteprojeto ou no projeto b&amp;aacute;sico;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) no caso de obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de meio, estabelecimento preciso das fra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do objeto com rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;agrave;s quais n&amp;atilde;ohaver&amp;aacute; liberdade para os contratados inovarem em solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es metodol&amp;oacute;gicas ou tecnol&amp;oacute;gicas, devendo haver obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;ode ader&amp;ecirc;ncia entre a execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o predefinida no anteprojeto ou no projeto b&amp;aacute;sico, consideradas ascaracter&amp;iacute;sticas do regime de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o no caso de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os de engenharia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 18. A fase preparat&amp;oacute;ria do processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio &amp;eacute; caracterizada pelo planejamento e deve compatibilizar-se com o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual de que trata o inciso VII do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 desta Lei, sempre que elaborado, e com as leis or&amp;ccedil;ament&amp;aacute;rias, bem como abordar todas as considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es t&amp;eacute;cnicas, mercadol&amp;oacute;gicas e de gest&amp;atilde;o que podem interferir na contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, compreendidos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;X - a an&amp;aacute;lise dos riscos que possam comprometer o sucesso da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a boa execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o contratual.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="runtimeProperties" value="{&quot;priority&quot;:0,&quot;asynchronousBehavior&quot;:{},&quot;subProcessType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;inputMappingType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;outputMappingType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;exitMode&quot;:&quot;AllTokens&quot;}" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_bd1640ee-9945-400f-bffa-a381ebccbc14</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_13aafc04-75c5-40c5-ae38-c2540d05cf60</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_0bd32745-4ee4-402b-8620-056a9a9856a3">
        <dataOutput id="Id_d2177222-144f-43fd-b913-f0d65cfa8abe">
          <documentation />
          <dataState id="Id_7b2e4425-b0ed-45db-ac59-c92f3c620693" />
